      "message": "Removing the details write-back also removes the only thing that got a changed push token onto already-established proxy subscriptions: DhtProxyClient::setPushNotificationToken just assigns deviceKey_, and restartListeners only runs on a Disconnected→Connected transition, so live listens keep the old token. That matters in the case the token set right after account creation, when dht_ came up with an empty deviceKey.",
